  "appliesTo": "Schools set their own start and finish times. Contact your school to find out what time the school day finishes on the last day of term.",
  "academyNote": "",
  "localFacts": [
    {"fact": "Edinburgh has its own local holidays: an autumn holiday on a Monday in September, an Edinburgh spring holiday on the Monday after the Easter break, and Victoria Day on a Monday in late May.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/downloads/file/34530/school-term-dates-2026-27"},
    {"fact": "The council sets five in-service days for all schools, placed after the October break, after Christmas, after the May Day holiday and on the two days before pupils return in August.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/downloads/file/34530/school-term-dates-2026-27"},
    {"fact": "The timetable gives 190 days for pupils and 195 for staff, split as 86, 56 and 48 pupil days across the three terms of 2026-27.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/downloads/file/34530/school-term-dates-2026-27"},
    {"fact": "Holiday dates on the council page are inclusive: for a break from 12 to 19 October, pupils return on the 20th.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/schools/term-dates"},
    {"fact": "The summer term ends on a Tuesday in 2027 (29 June) and on a Friday in 2028 (30 June).", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/schools/term-dates/2"},
    {"fact": "The council already publishes dates for 2028-29, with pupils returning on Wednesday 16 August 2028.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/downloads/file/40108/school-term-dates-2028-29"},
    {"fact": "Term dates are also offered as an iCal file to add to a phone or computer calendar.", "source": "https://www.edinburgh.gov.uk/downloads/download/15651/school-term-dates-2026-27-download"}
  ],
